Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:35:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(hud): show each line of Bedrock boss names

Bedrock's hud boss_name label shows every line of a boss name. Servers
such as Mystrick Games send names like "Lobby\n\nNew Minigame
Conquests!". Java's boss overlay draws one line, so the line breaks
rendered as stray glyphs and the subtitle sat on the title line.

Native evidence (Bedrock 1.26.60.5 client against a local BDS, withers
summoned with multi-line names): the lines form one block as wide as
its widest line, centered on the bar, with each line left-aligned and
10 GUI units apart. The first line keeps the title position and the bar
draws over the lines below it. On Bedrock connections, multi-line boss
names now use that layout. Single-line names and Java servers keep
Java's centered title.

diff --git a/src/main/java/com/viaversion/viafabricplus/bedrock/injection/mixin/features/render/MixinBossHealthOverlay.java b/src/main/java/com/viaversion/viafabricplus/bedrock/injection/mixin/features/render/MixinBossHealthOverlay.java
